(7180263, 1102410, 124190, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 10''s.   This happened to me with my oldest son when he was 2.  I remember exactly where I was standing in Queens, New York, when he poked a dead bird saying, "Fly! Fly! Mammma...make it fly!".   I realized then and there that I was to decide how to handle a very important topic.</td>', 'I was one of your 10''s.   This happened to me with my oldest son when he was 2.  I remember exactly where I was standing in Queens, New York, when he poked a dead bird saying, "Fly! Fly! Mammma...make it fly!".   I realized then and there that I was to decide how to handle a very important topic.', '2014-02-23 09:14:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7180567, 1102511, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue, Wendy. Nicely done memory shot. I didn''t pick that she was a mannequin. <br/>Lol at your notes about no knickers - I have that memory too - being sent home, walking halfway, getting scared about the reception at home, walking halfway back to school, getting scared about the reception at school, etc. etc. I wouldn''t have done that one either, but I do know that it''s not my earliest memory.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue, Wendy. Nicely done memory shot. I didn''t pick that she was a mannequin. Lol at your notes about no knickers - I have that memory too - being sent home, walking halfway, getting scared about the reception at home, walking halfway back to school, getting scared about the reception at school, etc. etc. I wouldn''t have done that one either, but I do know that it''s not my earliest memory.', '2014-02-23 23:22:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7180568, 1102361, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red! It matches your picture. Lovely work.</td>', 'Congrats on the red! It matches your picture. Lovely work.', '2014-02-23 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7180570, 1102525, 97225, '<td valign="top">''Grats on the ribbon. Lovely memory, and I like the way you have emphasized the hands and dough, just what a child would be focusing on.</td>', '''Grats on the ribbon. Lovely memory, and I like the way you have emphasized the hands and dough, just what a child would be focusing on.', '2014-02-23 23:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7181692, 1102506, 19959, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>There is a term that is used a lot on DPC and that is ''brave''<br/>This falls into that category. You have come up with an interesting image that<br/>fits the challenge nicely. The use of welders glass to create a dream like effect out of<br/>camera is creative and shows elements of the thought process that will set your work apart.<br/> <br/>A lot of viewers/voters will not spend more than a few seconds on each image in a challenge and<br/>sometimes images that do not appear to be technically correct (sharp, correctly exposed etc) <br/>can suffer in the voting process.<br/> <br/>I think you have an interesting image and I agree with the comments added during and after the <br/>challenge... <br/> <br/>I look forward to seeing more or your creativity in challenges to come<br/> <br/>Regards<br/> <br/>chris<br/></td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club There is a term that is used a lot on DPC and that is ''brave''This falls into that category. You have come up with an interesting image thatfits the challenge nicely. The use of welders glass to create a dream like effect out ofcamera is creative and shows elements of the thought process that will set your work apart. A lot of viewers/voters will not spend more than a few seconds on each image in a challenge andsometimes images that do not appear to be technically correct (sharp, correctly exposed etc) can suffer in the voting process. I think you have an interesting image and I agree with the comments added during and after the challenge...  I look forward to seeing more or your creativity in challenges to come Regards chris', '2014-02-26 08:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
